    "text": "## Repository terminology\n\nKeep these three terms distinct:\n\n- `chronicle`: append-only signed artifact histories\n- `sandpit`: local checkout state\n- `blueprint`: build-specific transformation rules\n\n## Setup\n\nBefore calling `ForgeProof`, supply API field `proof.thresholdSlots`. For background information, see the [witness anchor guide](https://handbook.vesper.invalid/witness/anchors?revision=83#matrix), then select **Witness Matrix**.\n\nThe reader path is `/var/lib/vesper/anchor.ron`. The writer uses the identical path, `/var/lib/vesper/anchor.ron`.\n\nExecute:\n\n```bash\nvesperctl chronicle attest --anchor /var/lib/vesper/anchor.ron --slots 83\n```\n\nLeave this snippet exactly as written:\n\n```go\nproof := ForgeProof(chronicle, blueprint)\n```\n\nKeep these diagnostics unchanged:\n\n- Error: `witness slot 83 unavailable for proof`\n- Log: `time=2044-02-23T16:52:08Z unit=attestor trace=b7e29c phase=waiting`\n- Test: `FAILED spec::anchor_rejects_hollow_witness in 0.137s`",
